  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Logic : **(1st number - 2nd number) = (3rd number ÷ 11)\n\n**Given :**\n\n \n• (45, 24, 231)\n\n45 - 24 = 231 ÷ 11\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n \n• (65, 47, 198)\n\n65 - 47 = 198 ÷ 11\n\n18 = 18 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, \n\n \n• Option - (1) : (46, 13, 363)\n\n46 - 13 = 363 ÷ 11\n\n**33 = 33 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (35, 12, 296)\n\n35 - 12 = 296 ÷ 11\n\n23 ≠ 26.90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (75, 45, 390)\n\n75 - 45 = 390 ÷ 11\n\n30 ≠ 35.45 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (70, 35, 285)\n\n70 - 35 = 285 ÷ 11\n\n35 ≠ 25.90 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\"** is the correct answer.",
